             13  *      Track 0  Sector 1  Data Format
             14  *                         -----------
             15  *
             16  *             0     2     4     6     8     A     C     E
             17  *          +-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+
             18  *   00     | WP  | PC  |-----|-----|-----|-----|-----|-----|
             19  *          +-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+
             20  *   10     |-----|-----| LN  | SA  |-----|-----|-----| CS  |
             21  *          +-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+
             22  *   20     | CO  | PY  | RI  | GH  | T^  | T.  | I.  | L^  |
             23  *          +-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+
             24  *   30     | BO  | OT  | ^L  | OA  | DE  | R^  | V1  | .0  |
             25  *          +-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+-----+
             26  *          ~     ~     ~     ~     ~     ~     ~     ~     ~
             27  *
             28  *      WP = Entry WP
             29  *      PC = Entry PC
             30  *      LN = Two times number of bytes to transfer
             31  *      SA = Load address for absolute code program
             32  *      CS = Checksum on words hex00 to hex1C inclusive
             33  *      ^  = Space Character
             34  *      All other locations are reserved for vector storage.
